{"step_index":10621,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T13:46:00Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. instance-20260925-131309    us-central1-a        \n10.128.0.3 (nic0)    35.253.244.80 (nic0)\n2. Pasted\n3. Official agy cli er folder structure kemon\n4. Agy cli er core achoron kon kon file er upore nirvor kore?\n5. Tumi je folder structure dila eitar source dao\n6. Tomar file structure thik nei based on article\n7. Assa, tumi kono kaaj naa korei folder Structure gulo reset korar upay ki? ETA AMI e karone bollam je, Agy cli first time installation e always default settings ei thakbe......folder Structure......But Evabe uninstall korle multiple gemini commmand center toiri hote paare,...so only ektai commmand center paoar upay ki? Ebong tumi nijei kono kaaj naa kore..,..default architecture paoar upay ki\n8. Accha azure e jokhon amra agy cli install korlam, tokhon tumi ki manually files alternate korsile?\n9. Azure er folder structure visit korar jonno, live link dao....arekta prosno ei linkgulo cloudflare er madhyome dite hoy keno? Amra to vm ei acchi.......vm theke direct site live kora jay naa? Jaihok ei link ta onek kisu visible naa,,,secondly,,,Ei link taar kono ek jaygay My computer naame Logo dao....eitate ami hubohu windows 11 er interface dekhte paabo.....ebong azure er sokol files dekhte paabo.....link creation er jonno irakiroan folder er vitore alada folder create koro\n10. Ei link e cpu activity chhilo jeta delete korla\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User's Immediate Request & Reaction:**\n  1. User said: *\"Ei link e cpu activity chhilo jeta delete korla\"* (\"In this link there was CPU activity which you deleted\").\n  2. The user noted that the previous web monitor link included real-time CPU / system resource activity graphs/metrics alongside the interface. When we replaced the server or launched the Windows 11 explorer, the user noticed the CPU activity widget/feature was missing or replaced.\n  3. The objective for the successor is to immediately integrate live CPU, RAM, and System activity monitoring (real-time usage percentages and graphs) directly into the Windows 11 File Explorer interface / \"This PC\" view without deleting or breaking the file explorer.\n- **Scope & Boundaries:**\n  - Workspace: `/home/azureuser/IrakIroan` (all link files kept strictly inside `/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/`).\n  - Interface requirements: Windows 11 Fluent UI + \"This PC\" / \"My Computer\" logo + Live CPU & RAM activity meter/graph + Full Azure file browsing.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Live Google Cloud VM Root Access: 100% ACHIEVED & VERIFIED.**\n  - Instance: `instance-20260925-131309`, Zone: `us-central1-a`, IP: `35.253.244.80`.\n  - User added public key `azureuser-to-google-vm`.\n  - Verified SSH connection: `mdkamruzzamanirak@35.253.244.80` with passwordless `sudo` root.\n  - Live GCP Disk: `/dev/sda1` 69 GB total, 67 GB used (100% full).\n  - Live GCP Home: `/home/mdkamruzzamanirak_gmail_com` = **57 GB** (590,055 files).\n  - Mystery solved: `.config/google-chrome` on GCP VM is **22 GB**, which explains why the live home was 56-57 GB while the cleaned archive was 38 GB (577,045 files).\n- **Windows 11 Azure File Explorer Deployed & Running:**\n  - Directory: [`/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer`](file:///home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer)\n  - Backend script: [`server.py`](file:///home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/server.py) (Port 8088).\n  - Frontend app: [`static/index.html`](file:///home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/static/index.html).\n  - Systemd service: `azure-file-explorer.service` (Active &