n  - Task `10620` (`find / -name \"*live_resource_monitor*\"`) was running in background; successor should kill it if still running to save I/O.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Kill Background Task 10620:**\n   - Run `manage_task(Action='kill', TaskId='47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/task-10620')` to avoid unnecessary disk scan.\n2. **Add Live CPU & RAM Activity API to `server.py`:**\n   - In [`/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/server.py`](file:///home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/server.py), add a lightweight `get_system_stats()` function:\n     - CPU usage via two consecutive reads of `/proc/stat` (100ms delta) or `os.getloadavg()`.\n     - Memory usage via `/proc/meminfo` (`MemTotal`, `MemAvailable`).\n   - Add endpoint `GET /api/system_stats`.\n3. **Enhance `static/index.html` with Windows 11 Task Manager / CPU Activity Meter:**\n   - In \"This PC\" view, right above or next to \"Devices and Drives\", add a dedicated **\"System Performance & CPU Activity\"** card:\n     - Real-time CPU Activity meter (animated SVG sparkline / progress bar with live % updated every second).\n     - Real-time Memory usage (GB used / Total GB).\n     - Server Hostname: `FatehAli (Azure VM)` & Load Average.\n4. **Restart `azure-file-explorer.service`:**\n   - Run `systemctl --user restart azure-file-explorer.service`.\n5. **Verify and Present to Iraq Bhai:**\n   - Confirm with `curl http://localhost:8088/api/system_stats`.\n   - Send the live link `https://constraint-marion-casio-aircraft.trycloudflare.com` to Iraq Bhai with a clear explanation in pure Bengali, showing that CPU activity has been restored directly inside the Windows 11 interface.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Address user as: \"ইরাক ভাইয়া\".\n- Language: Pure Bengali script (বাংলা লিপি).\n- Formatting: Single asterisks `*` only (NO `**`), clamped dividers `«──────────────────────────────»` (30-32 chars), max line length 48-50 chars, clickable `file://